# Test My Mettle (otherAreas 25): Selbina's Devean (no script; default 124) and Davoi's Jar (no script; default
# NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY). A level 10 Warrior of Bastok (nation 1: the check reads getRank(getNation())), rank 2,
# Selbina / Rabao fame level 2 (San d'Oria 75: (75 + 0) * 2 / 3 = 50), 2000 gil, a Chocobo Feather. Available: the
# feather traded to Devean: no trade handler: nothing (the sandals while available: `#edges`). Devean 120 (0, the Power
# Sandals, 0, 0, 0, the Flint Stone). Finishes: option 0: nothing; the cancel bit (1 << 30, plus 1024): nothing; 1024
# (the 1000 bet, 24 hours): 1000 gil taken, Timer = now + 3456, Reward = 1000 * 3.0, begun. Accepted: Devean 121 (the
# sandals, 24). Davoi: the Jar: the sandals given, the jar moved (randomInt(125, 10800), Davoi_Jar_Move_Time, the new
# spot's draws, the move 3000 ms later: the tick), noAction; again, with the sandals: nil: the Jar's default. Selbina:
# the sandals traded while the timer runs: 122; finished: completed (no reward), the sandals taken, 3000 gil, fame +5
# San d'Oria and Bastok, Repeat = JstMidnight() (Timer, Reward and Option cleared by quest:complete first). Completed,
# Repeat in the future: no section: 124; the feather traded: nothing. A JST day later: 120 again (completed is not
# accepted); the feather traded (section 1 holds, no trade handler): nothing; option 1024: the gil taken, Timer and
# Reward set, quest:begin's addQuest sets the current bit, but the completed bit wins (getQuestStatus): still completed,
# so Devean plays 120 again, not 121 (a Lua quirk, kept: the quest is never accepted again once completed; `#timer`).
# An option of 1 to 100 (no bet below it) makes the Lua error on `player:getGil() >= nil` (a `lua:` line, which the
# recorder refuses): XI.Verify.Quests `oa g3 tmm` proves the C# does nothing there.
lists Selbina/Devean/onTrigger Selbina/Devean/onTrade Davoi/Jar/onTrigger Selbina/onEventFinish/120 Selbina/onEventFinish/122
char zone=Selbina pos=41.4,-14.6,40 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=1 gil=2000
rank 2
fame Sandoria 75
item ChocoboFeather
login
trade Devean ChocoboFeather x1          # available: no trade handler: nothing
trigger Devean                          # 120 (0, Power Sandals, 0, 0, 0, Flint Stone)
finish option=0                         # nothing
trigger Devean                          # 120
finish option=1073742848                # bit.rshift(option, 30) == 1: cancelled: nothing
trigger Devean                          # 120
finish option=1024                      # the 1000 bet, 24 hours: 1000 gil taken; Timer now + 3456; Reward 3000; begun
trigger Devean                          # accepted, the timer running: 121 (Power Sandals, 24)
finish
warp -94.1,2.5,-50.8 Davoi
trigger Jar                             # no sandals: given; the jar moved (3000 ms later); noAction
tick 4000                               # the queued move runs
trigger Jar                             # the sandals held: nil: NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY (the default)
warp 41.4,-14.6,40 Selbina
trade Devean PowerSandals x1            # the timer running: 122
finish                                  # completed; the sandals taken; 3000 gil; fame +5 x2; Repeat = JstMidnight()
trigger Devean                          # Repeat in the future: no section: 124
finish
trade Devean ChocoboFeather x1          # completed, no section: nothing
wait jst=1
trigger Devean                          # Repeat passed, completed: 120
finish option=0
trade Devean ChocoboFeather x1          # completed, section 1 holds: no trade handler: nothing
trigger Devean                          # 120
finish option=1024                      # 1000 gil taken; Timer now + 3456; Reward 3000; addQuest: still completed
trigger Devean                          # the completed bit wins: 120 again
finish option=0
